sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend
    participant Redis as Redis (refresh store)

    U->>FE: Session continues (access token expiring)
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/refresh (refresh cookie)
    API->>Redis: lookup refresh token
    alt token valid and unused
        Redis-->>API: valid
        API->>Redis: revoke old, store new token
        API-->>FE: new access + refresh tokens
    else token already used once before
        Redis-->>API: reuse detected
        API->>Redis: revoke entire token family
        API-->>FE: 401 — force re-login (possible theft)
    end
